<div class="form-card">
  <div class="form-card-title">6. Konten Footer Publik</div>

  <div class="form-row-2">
    <div class="form-group">
      <div class="stg-field-head">
        <label class="form-label" for="footer_desc_id">Deskripsi Perusahaan Footer (Bahasa Indonesia)</label>
        <span class="stg-char-count" id="footerDescIdCount" aria-live="polite"><%= (settings.footer_desc_id || '').length %> / 350</span>
      </div>
      <textarea id="footer_desc_id" name="footer_desc_id" class="form-textarea stg-footer-textarea" rows="3" maxlength="350" data-counter-target="footerDescIdCount" aria-describedby="footerDescIdHint"><%= settings.footer_desc_id || '' %></textarea>
      <div class="form-hint" id="footerDescIdHint">Tampil di sisi kiri atas footer publik Bahasa Indonesia. Terpisah dari meta description SEO halaman.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <div class="stg-field-head">
        <label class="form-label" for="footer_desc_en">Deskripsi Perusahaan Footer (English)</label>
        <span class="stg-char-count" id="footerDescEnCount" aria-live="polite"><%= (settings.footer_desc_en || '').length %> / 350</span>
      </div>
      <textarea id="footer_desc_en" name="footer_desc_en" class="form-textarea stg-footer-textarea" rows="3" maxlength="350" data-counter-target="footerDescEnCount" aria-describedby="footerDescEnHint"><%= settings.footer_desc_en || '' %></textarea>
      <div class="form-hint" id="footerDescEnHint">Tampil di sisi kiri atas footer publik Bahasa Inggris. Maksimal 350 karakter.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="stg-footer-repeater" id="footerNavRepeaterContainer">
    <input type="hidden" id="footer_nav_links_json" name="footer_nav_links_json" value="<%= settings.footer_nav_links_json || '[]' %>">

    <div class="stg-footer-header">
      <div class="stg-footer-title">
        <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg>
        <span>Tautan Menu Footer Kanan (Maksimal 4 Item)</span>
      </div>
      <span id="footerNavCountBadge" class="stg-footer-count-badge" aria-live="polite">0 / 4 Menu</span>
    </div>

    <p class="stg-footer-desc">
      Atur daftar tautan di sisi kanan footer. Mendukung path internal (mis. <code>/products</code> atau <code>/about#sertifikasi</code>), anchor (<code>#...</code>), maupun URL eksternal (<code>https://...</code>).
    </p>

    <div id="footerNavEmptyHint" class="stg-footer-empty stg-d-none">
      Belum ada menu footer aktif. Saat 0 item disimpan, kolom menu kanan disembunyikan dan footer publik menyesuaikan menjadi 1 kolom penuh.
    </div>

    <div id="footerNavList" class="stg-footer-list" role="list" aria-label="Daftar menu footer publik"></div>

    <div class="stg-footer-actions">
      <button type="button" class="adm-btn adm-btn-secondary adm-btn-sm stg-footer-add-btn" id="btnAddFooterNav" aria-label="Tambah item menu footer baru">
        <svg class="adm-btn-icon adm-btn-icon-plus" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line></svg>
        <span>Tambah Menu</span>
      </button>
      <span class="stg-footer-hint" id="footerNavLimitHint">Maksimal 4 item menu. Tautan eksternal http(s):// otomatis terbuka di tab baru secara aman.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

